{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Chertovica is a dark fantasy boomershooter focused on melee combat.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lilith</strong> herself has woken you up from your eternal sleep. Demons are upon your world and you are the one who is going to stop them. Will you pick the <strong>Light</strong> and become a <strong>Holy Knight</strong>, or <strong>Darkness</strong> and gain the power of <strong>Vampire Lord</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/MeetingWithLucifer.gif?t=1741936510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unsheathe your sword, load your pistol</strong> and obliterate your way through possessed ex-humans, divo\u017eienky, rabid wolves and other vermin seeking to transform this world to a proper hellscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/FightingDemons.gif?t=1741936510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secrets hidden behind half-crumbling walls. Explore dark catacombs of despair or old monastery grounds which were supposed to be your final resting ground. Experience the thick atmosphere of a demon invasion, but are the horrors coming from hell, or are you, the horror, coming to hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/extras/Monastery.gif?t=1741936510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320270?t=1741936510","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320270?t=1741936510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320270/1f7d82ebd1d0a91e8fc99f74a374